nse\",\"Best-in-class fuel efficiency of up to 25.75 kmpl\",\"Excellent resale value and Maruti Suzuki service backing\"}', '{\"Cabin plastic materials feel basic and scratchy\",\"Rear seating legroom is slightly tight for tall adults\",\"Lightweight build compared to European competitors\"}', 163);
